G1 E5.02327 F2100 ; final retract
G92 E0                   ; reset extruder
G1 Z5.0 F3000            ; lift nozzle
M104 S0                  ; turn off hotend
M140 S0                  ; turn off bed
M107                     ; turn off fan
G28 X Y                  ; home X and Y
M84                      ; disable steppers
